            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 4344,
            "text": "{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0aad29c1/mx42zQYk9g-gb9SaNjb3i_6f9ab1ac26d448519275d0d935a95c0d.png\",\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"file_name\":\"6f9ab1ac26d448519275d0d935a95c0d.png\",\"file_size\":1559835,\"width\":880,\"height\":1168},\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0aad29c1/mx42zQYk9g-gb9SaNjb3i_6f9ab1ac26d448519275d0d935a95c0d.png\"}],\"structured_instruction\":{\"short_description\":\"A woman with long, dark hair, wearing a camel-colored coat and a black top, is walking outdoors on a city street. She is holding a light green can of \\\"AQUAVIT\\\" with a lemon illustration in her right hand, looking slightly to her right with a calm expression. The background features blurred city buildings and trees under bright daylight.\",\"objects\":[{\"description\":\"A young woman with long, wavy dark brown hair, parted on the side, is walking on a city street. She is wearing a stylish camel-colored double-breasted coat over a black top and blue jeans. Her right arm is slightly bent, holding the can, while her left arm is mostly obscured by her body and coat. She has a natural, calm expression.\",\"location\":\"center\",\"relationship\":\"The woman is the main subject, holding the AQUAVIT can.\",\"relative_size\":\"large within frame\",\"shape_and_color\":\"Human figure, warm brown coat, black top, blue jeans.\",\"texture\":\"Smooth fabric of the coat, soft hair.\",\"appearance_details\":\"She wears small hoop earrings and a delicate necklace. Her skin has a warm, tanned tone.\",\"pose\":\"Walking with her right arm bent, holding an object. Her body is angled slightly to the left, and her head is turned to the right.\",\"expression\":\"Calm and pleasant, with a slight smile.\",\"clothing\":\"Camel-colored double-breasted coat, black top, blue jeans.\",\"action\":\"Walking and holding a beverage can.\",\"gender\":\"Female\",\"skin_tone_and_texture\":\"Warm, tanned skin tone, smooth texture.\",\"orientation\":\"Facing slightly right, body angled left.\"},{\"description\":\"A sleek, tall, light green aluminum can with a silver top and bottom. The front features the word \\\"AQUAVIT\\\" in dark blue text, below which is an illustration of a lemon branch with a whole lemon, a lemon slice, and white flowers with green leaves.\",\"location\":\"center-right, held in the woman's right hand\",\"relationship\":\"The can is being held by the woman.\",\"relative_size\":\"small\",\"shape_and_color\":\"Cylindrical, light green with silver accents.\",\"texture\":\"Smooth, metallic.\",\"appearance_details\":\"The branding \\\"AQUAVIT\\\" is prominently displayed, along with a detailed botanical illustration of a lemon.\",\"orientation\":\"Upright, slightly angled as held by the woman.\"}],\"background_setting\":\"An urban street scene with blurred buildings and trees in the background, suggesting a bustling city environment. The pavement is visible in the foreground.\",\"lighting\":{\"conditions\":\"Bright daylight\",\"direction\":\"Side-lit from the right, with some front lighting.\",\"shadows\":\"Soft, subtle shadows cast by the woman and objects, consistent with outdoor daylight.\"},\"aesthetics\":{\"composition\":\"Medium shot, rule of thirds, with the woman positioned slightly to the left of center.\",\"color_scheme\":\"Warm tones from the woman's coat and skin, contrasted with the cool green of the can and the muted blues and grays of the city background.\",\"mood_atmosphere\":\"Casual, fresh, and urban.\",\"aesthetic_score\":\"very high\",\"preference_score\":\"very high\"},\"photographic_characteristics\":{\"depth_of_field\":\"Shallow, with the woman and the can in sharp focus and the background blurred.\",\"focus\":\"Sharp focus on the woman and the can.\",\"camera_angle\":\"Eye-level\",\"lens_focal_length\":\"portrait lens (e.g., 50mm-85mm)\"},\"style_medium\":\"photograph\",\"context\":\"This is a concept for a lifestyle advertisement featuring a beverage product in an urban setting.\",\"artistic_style\":\"realistic\",\"edit_instruction\":\"Integrate the product from <image_2> into the scene from <image_1>, so that the person is naturally holding the product, preserving the person's identity, face, expression, clothing, pose, and background, and the product's exact geometry, colors, materials, branding, and label text, while adjusting only the person's arm and hand position for a physically plausible grip with correct product scale, perspective, natural finger placement, occlusion, and consistent lighting, shadows, and reflections.\"}}"
